{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Linux创建带可疑命令行的Pod或容器。对应需求：执行。官方：Pod or Container Creation with Suspicious Command-Line。","from":"now-9m","index":["auditbeat-*","endgame-*","logs-auditd_manager.auditd-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Linux创建带可疑命令行的Pod或容器","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nLinux创建带可疑命令行的Pod或容器\n\n### 为何重要\n在主机或容器内执行代码\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程与用户。\n2. 核对路径、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与持久化。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","risk_score":47,"rule_id":"c595363f-52a6-49e1-9257-0e08ae043dbd","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Linux","主题: 执行","来源: 默认","对应需求: 执行"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"linux\" and event.type == \"start\" and event.action in (\"exec\", \"exec_event\", \"start\", \"ProcessRollup2\", \"executed\", \"process_started\") and (\n  (process.name == \"kubectl\" and process.args == \"run\" and process.args == \"--restart=Never\" and process.args == \"--\") or\n  (process.name in (\"docker\", \"nerdctl\", \"ctl\") and process.args == \"run\")\n) and \nprocess.args in (\"bash\", \"dash\", \"sh\", \"tcsh\", \"csh\", \"zsh\", \"ksh\", \"fish\") and\nprocess.command_line like~ (\n  \"*atd*\", \"*cron*\", \"*/etc/rc.local*\", \"*/dev/tcp/*\", \"*/etc/init.d*\", \"*/etc/update-motd.d*\", \"*/etc/ld.so*\", \"*/etc/sudoers*\", \"*base64 *\",\n  \"*/etc/profile*\", \"*/etc/ssh*\", \"*/home/*/.ssh/*\", \"*/root/.ssh*\" , \"*~/.ssh/*\", \"*autostart*\", \"*xxd *\", \"*/etc/shadow*\", \"*./.*\",\n  \"*import*pty*spawn*\", \"*import*subprocess*call*\", \"*TCPSocket.new*\", \"*TCPSocket.open*\", \"*io.popen*\", \"*os.execute*\", \"*fsockopen*\",\n  \"*disown*\", \"* ncat *\", \"* nc *\", \"* netcat *\",  \"* nc.traditional *\", \"*socat*\", \"*telnet*\", \"*/tmp/*\", \"*/dev/shm/*\", \"*/var/tmp/*\",\n  \"*/boot/*\", \"*/sys/*\", \"*/lost+found/*\", \"*/media/*\", \"*/proc/*\", \"*/var/backups/*\", \"*/var/log/*\", \"*/var/mail/*\", \"*/var/spool/*\"\n)\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.004","name":"Unix Shell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/004/"}]},{"id":"T1609","name":"Container Administration Command","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1609/"},{"id":"T1610","name":"Deploy Container","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1610/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1548","name":"Abuse Elevation Control Mechanism","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1548.003","name":"Sudo and Sudo Caching","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1548/003/"}]},{"id":"T1574","name":"Hijack Execution Flow","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1574/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1574.006","name":"Dynamic Linker Hijacking","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1574/006/"}]},{"id":"T1611","name":"Escape to Host","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1611/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1037","name":"Boot or Logon Initialization Scripts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1037/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1037.004","name":"RC Scripts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1037/004/"}]},{"id":"T1053","name":"Scheduled Task/Job","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1053.002","name":"At","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/002/"},{"id":"T1053.003","name":"Cron","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1053/003/"}]},{"id":"T1098","name":"Account Manipulation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1098.004","name":"SSH Authorized Keys","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/004/"}]},{"id":"T1546","name":"Event Triggered Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1546/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1546.004","name":"Unix Shell Configuration Modification","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1546/004/"}]},{"id":"T1547","name":"Boot or Logon Autostart Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1547/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1547.013","name":"XDG Autostart Entries","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1547/013/"}]},{"id":"T1574","name":"Hijack Execution Flow","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1574/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1574.006","name":"Dynamic Linker Hijacking","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1574/006/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、开发或自动化脚本"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"auditd_manager","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件事件）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","file.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"version":3,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"}